<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-DIGITEL FIRST HALF NET UP 120 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-DIGITEL FIRST HALF NET UP 120 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			     506.10 vs 229.54</p>
<p>    Operating revenues		   840.93 vs 440.47</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)	   0.08 vs   0.05</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Digital Telecommunications Philippines Inc (Digitel). The company said higher revenues were a result of increased telephone lines, higher use of its international gateway facility and increased number of interconnected circuits with Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co.</p>
